      "MIMOCODE_DISABLE_PROJECT_CONFIG": "Disables project mimocode.json/mimocode.jsonc discovery, project .mimocode directory discovery, and project AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md instruction discovery. It does not suppress MIMOCODE_CONFIG_DIR or configured skills.paths loading.",
